<Layout title="about">
  <h1>about</h1>

  <p>
    Hi, I'm Rob. Engineer, sometime writer, dad to four boys and a rabbit. Based in Sydney.
  </p>

  <p>
    This is my personal blog. It's a rough archive of things I've found
    interesting since 2005 — technology, music, occasional photos, and a
    long tail of link posts from an era when everyone had a Delicious
    account and thought RSS would save the world.
  </p>

  <p>
    The site has been through a few homes: Posterous, then Jekyll, then
    Gatsby, and now <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>. Every
    migration has broken something — apologies for any dead images or 404s
    you find in the older posts.
  </p>

  <p>
    You can find me on the internet as
    <a href="https://github.com/qnm" rel="me">@qnm on GitHub</a>. If you
    want to get in touch, that's probably the fastest way.
  </p>
</Layout>
